    <region left="0" top="27" width="777" height="23" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="777" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">1. Recreate the circuit in LTspice using ideal amplifiers, a diode, and transistors.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
