    <region left="0" top="432" width="771" height="23" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="771" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">2. Select a 741 amplifier and include the model in LTSpice.</p>
