      <text lang="eng" width="777" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">3. Select the transistors and diode to be used (provide justification) and include the model in LTSpice.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
